1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,830
At the cowshed the cowherds think of running away, but they know they would be caught.

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:12,799
Laxminarayan runs ahead of the convoy and orders them to massage the bull's back feet and fan it, as if it were alive.

3
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:15,664
The king arrives and calls the bull by name.

4
00:00:15,664 --> 00:00:16,679
No breath.

5
00:00:16,679 --> 00:00:19,726
The tail has gone loose, the ears have dropped.

6
00:00:19,726 --> 00:00:21,367
It is dead, he says.

